  {
    "@id": "https://www.musicaintima.org/event-details/ding-dong-in-delta",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "ding dong in Delta! | musica intima"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Here we go again, this time in Ladner! Burnt-out musicians; cynical grinches; die-hard Christmas fans - there’s something here for everyone! An annual sell-out, your favourite casual and slightly unhinged concert-going experience returns, this year highlighting the beauty and power of acappella voices as we revisit ensemble and audience favourite arrangements from the last 9 years of Ding Dongs.</p>"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
