    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In co-production with and generously hosted by the NOW Society, join Andrew and mi at 8East at 7pm on February 3rd for a FREE 90 minute workshop on the project - explore the genesis and impact of NAGAMO through this unique opportunity to work with its curator."
