        "@value": " We’re returning to the jazz roots of Ding Dongs of Christmas-past, featuring Sharon Minemoto, Jodi Proznick and Kate Johnson, who will join us in roasted chestnuts from Jackson Browne, Donny Hathaway, Ingrid Michaelson and The Pretenders."
