        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Continuing our work with Indigenous choreographer Olivia C Davies, we return to tell more of the story of w<em>here you go </em>weaving together voices, dance, lighting and costume design, to create an immersive journey through love, friendship and devotion.</p>"
